    - {system: "Claude Code", model: "Claude Opus 4.8 (effort Max)", b3: 31.73, b4: 29.59, overall: 37.51, repeats: 3}
    - {system: "Codex", model: "GPT-5.5 (xhigh)", b3: 29.29, b4: 30.46, overall: 38.15, repeats: 3}
    - {system: "Claude Code", model: "GLM-5.3", b3: 33.09, b4: 35.01, overall: 41.65, repeats: 3}
    - {system: "Claude Code", model: "Kimi K3", b3: 27.78, b4: 29.57, overall: 37.09, repeats: 3}
    - {system: "OpenHands", model: "DeepSeek V4 Flash", b3: 21.91, b4: 24.99, overall: 30.60, repeats: 3}
  leaderboard_only_rows: "Claude Code + Gemini 3.8 Flash B3 37.79；Claude Code + GLM-5.3-Flash B3 30.70；Claude Code + Qwen3.8-Max B3 29.37（1 次）；这三行不在论文里，是维护者提供的汇总"
  other_rows_in_paper_table_2: "论文 Table 2 另有 Claude Code + GLM-5.2、DeepSeek V4 Flash/Pro、Kimi K2.7、MiniMax M3、MiMo V2.5 Pro，Kimi Code + Kimi K3/K2.7，OpenHands + DeepSeek V4 Pro，MiMo Code + MiMo V2.5 Pro 等 18 个配置，B3 在 11.50–33.09 之间"
  all_rows_mean: "榜单 21 行 B1/B2/B3/B4 均值 51.72 / 29.72 / 27.48 / 27.63；B3−B4 均值 −0.15"
  per_item_time: "论文 Figure 4：每任务平均 execution time（所有配置的平均）B1 37.8 分钟、B2 49.7、B3 45.9、B4 44.5；论文没有说明是否墙钟，没有区分完成与失败，也没有逐题时间；官方每题超时 10,800 秒。每任务平均 token：B1 4.35M、B2 6.91M、B3 5.4M、B4 5.7M"
  not_found: "AutoResearchClaw、EvoScientist、Agentic Scientist、ResearchWorld 在 ASI-Bench 上的公开分数"

